# One statically supported rule.
Filter<p0 a0>(Input<t0>)|Filter<p1 a1>(Input<t1>)|TableEq(t1,t0);AttrsEq(a1,a0);PredicateEq(p1,p0)

# Sort is supported through ORCA's fused CLogicalLimit representation.
SortAsc<a0>(Input<t0>)|SortAsc<a1>(Input<t1>)|TableEq(t1,t0);AttrsEq(a1,a0)

# Input can be nested but cannot be dispatched as a source root.
Input<t0>|Input<t1>|TableEq(t1,t0)

# Deliberately malformed, to verify per-line parse failure reporting.
Filter<p0 a0>(Input<t0>)|Filter<p1 a1>(Input<t1>)|AttrsEq(a1,

# A non-EQ verdict is inventoried but excluded from the trusted corpus.
Filter<p0 a0>(Input<t0>)|Filter<p1 a1>(Input<t1>)|TableEq(t1,t0)	NEQ
